== Notes ==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* An existing keen property will block the addition of the keen property from this spell. In particular, a player should wait for this spell to expire before casting it again on the same weapon.
* When cast on a creature, the spell affects the slashing melee weapon in the creature's [[main hand slot|main hand]] (if there is one).
* [[Creature weapon]]s are never targeted (nor would the addition of keen be effective if they were targeted).

